00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:15,350
You learn how to write an essay introducing a character through essay: Patriotic Intellectual.

2
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:24,950
You read together the title and full essay.

3
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:32,880
Patriotic Intellectual

4
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:40,730
Dang Van Ngu

5
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:52,280
Dang Van Ngu (1910-1967) is a famous doctor of Vietnam.

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:01:07,440
In 1948, doctor Dang Van Ngu left Japan to return to country, join resistance war against French colonists.

7
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:13,060
Even through deep forest or deep stream,

8
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:33,820
Even through deep forest or deep stream, at all times he kept beside him a penicillin culture bottle he made from Japan.

9
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:45,110
Thanks to that, we succeeded in making medicine to treat wounded soldiers.

10
00:01:45,880 --> 00:02:05,680
In 1967, after many days of research, he made anti-malaria medicine and injected first doses into his own body.

11
00:02:06,130 --> 00:02:17,440
The medicine produced, initially highly effective.

12
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:32,240
But at that time, an enemy bomb took away our patriotic and devoted intellectual.

13
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:49,880
Doctor Dang Van Ngu was posthumously awarded Ho Chi Minh Prize in Medicine field.

14
00:02:50,530 --> 00:03:06,640
His name is given to many schools, streets in Hanoi, Hue, Quang Binh, Ho Chi Minh City.

